  "setup": "Fresh context. Open /app, seed identical library into existing IndexedDB state/library, reload dashboard, open Our farm words editor. Russian is the saved play language and play labels intentionally stay English. Capture board. Open first card; Before additionally chooses the existing lower Russian translation control (captured separately); After inherits Russian into its main fields. Both return to the first Position row before the matched card capture. Baseline already supports lower translation fields; this is not evidence that translation editing was entirely absent.",
